Bind Npc 24407 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 14407 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 630 "Reporting Results"
    Journal for karus "You must report to [Advisor] Herga."
    Journal for elmorad "You must report to [Advisor] Nez."
    Collect 1 of 900197000

Requires (player level >= 63 and player is karus and quest 628 is completed) or (player level >= 63 and player is elmorad and quest 629 is completed)

Rewards
    Give 125000 experience
    Give 10000 coins

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "The subjugation is now complete. Give this [Subjugation Report] to Herga, the [advisor]."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "The subjugation is now complete. Give this [Subjugation Report] to Nez, the [advisor]."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Is that you, <selfname>? What's going on?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Is this a report from the [Goblin Subjugation Squad] that was dispatched to the Goblin village?\n\nHerga the Subjugation results report to the Luferson Castle [advisor] must be passed."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Is that you, <selfname>? What's going on?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Is this a report from the [Goblin Subjugation Squad] that was dispatched to the Goblin village?\n\n[Advisor]Nez El Morad Castle must be passed to the the Subjugation results report."

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "You need to stop messing around!"
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Stop messing around. You are making me angry."

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "Oh, the subjugation is complete. You contributed to this greatly, <selfname>. Great work."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "The subjugation is complete. You contributed to this greatly, <selfname>. Great work."
